TI  - Toward rational use of cognitive training in those with mild cognitive impairment.
AU  - Hampstead BM
AU  - Stringer AY
AU  - Iordan AD
AU  - Ploutz-Snyder R
AU  - Sathian K
PY  - 2023 Mar
JO  - Alzheimer's & dementia : the journal of the Alzheimer's Association
VL  - 19
