TI  - Effects of 6-Month Combined Physical Exercise and Cognitive Training on Neuropsychological and Neurophysiological Function in Older Adults with Subjective Cognitive Decline: A Randomized Controlled Trial.
AU  - Cheng CH
AU  - Hsieh YW
AU  - Chang CC
AU  - Hsiao FJ
AU  - Chen LF
AU  - Wang PN
PY  - 2024
JO  - Journal of Alzheimer's disease : JAD
VL  - 100
