TI  - Combined Cognitive Training and Vortioxetine Mitigates Age-Related Declines in Functional Brain Network Integrity.
AU  - Waring JD
AU  - Williams SE
AU  - Stevens A
AU  - Pogarčić A
AU  - Shimony JS
AU  - Snyder AZ
AU  - Bowie CR
