TI  - Effects of 12-month physical and cognitive training on sarcopenia determinants in older adults: a subgroup analysis of a randomised clinical trial.
AU  - Hämäläinen OO
AU  - Savikangas TM
AU  - Tirkkonen AK
AU  - Alén MJ
AU  - Hautala AJ
AU  - Sipilä S
