TI  - Effectiveness of Chair-Based Exercises and Cognitive Training With Synchronous Telerehabilitation Method in Healthy Older Adults: A Pilot Randomised Controlled Study.
AU  - Kabul EG
AU  - Akar B
AU  - Calik BB
PY  - 2025 Nov
JO  - Psychogeriatrics : the official journal of the Japanese Psychogeriatric Society
VL  - 25
