TI  - Memory training in the ACTIVE study: how much is needed and who benefits?
AU  - Rebok GW
AU  - Langbaum JB
AU  - Jones RN
AU  - Gross AL
AU  - Parisi JM
AU  - Spira AP
AU  - Kueider AM
AU  - Petras H
