TI  - The differential effect of strength, cognitive and aerobic training combinations on cognitive performance and functional abilities in elderly with cognitive decline: The Fit4Alz project.
AU  - Silva AF
AU  - Assis G
AU  - Silva RM
AU  - Murawska-Ciałowicz E
AU  - Zurek G
AU  - Carvalho J
AU  - Roriz MS
AU  - Azevedo JA
AU  - Sampaio A
AU  - Bento T
