TI  - Predicting Working Memory Training Responsiveness in Parkinson's Disease: Both "System Hardware" and Room for Improvement Are Needed.
AU  - Ophey A
AU  - Rehberg S
AU  - Giehl K
AU  - Eggers C
AU  - Reker P
AU  - van Eimeren T
AU  - Kalbe E
