TI  - A Combined Intervention of Aerobic Exercise and Video Game in Older Adults: The Efficacy and Neural Basis on Improving Mnemonic Discrimination.
AU  - Cui X
AU  - Gui W
AU  - Miao J
AU  - Liu X
AU  - Zhu X
AU  - Zheng Z
AU  - Wan W
AU  - Shao Q
AU  - Kray J
