TI  - Primary outcome from the augmenting cognitive training in older adults study (ACT): A tDCS and cognitive training randomized clinical trial.
AU  - Hausman HK
AU  - Alexander GE
AU  - Cohen R
AU  - Marsiske M
AU  - DeKosky ST
AU  - Hishaw GA
AU  - O'Shea A
