TI  - Intrinsic Capacity and Active and Healthy Aging Domains Supported by Personalized Digital Coaching: Survey Study Among Geriatricians in Europe and Japan on eHealth Opportunities for Older Adults.
AU  - Stara V
AU  - Soraci L
AU  - Takano E
AU  - Kondo I
AU  - Möller J
AU  - Maranesi E
AU  - Luzi R
AU  - Riccardi GR
AU  - Browne R
