TI  - APOE genotype, hippocampal volume, and cognitive reserve predict improvement by cognitive training in older adults without dementia: a randomized controlled trial.
AU  - Montejo Carrasco P
AU  - Montenegro-Peña M
AU  - Prada Crespo D
AU  - Rodríguez Rojo I
AU  - Barabash Bustelo A
