TI  - Longitudinal impact and effects of booster sessions in a cognitive training program for healthy older adults.
AU  - Felix LM
AU  - Mansur-Alves M
AU  - Teles M
AU  - Jamison L
AU  - Golino H
PY  - 2021 May-Jun
JO  - Archives of gerontology and geriatrics
VL  - 94
