TI  - Verbal prompting to improve everyday cognition in MCI and unimpaired older adults.
AU  - Thomas KR
AU  - Marsiske M
PY  - 2014 Jan
JO  - Neuropsychology
VL  - 28
IS  - 1
SP  - 123-34
