TI  - Effects of daily L-dopa administration on learning and brain structure in older adults undergoing cognitive training: a randomised clinical trial.
AU  - Lebedev AV
AU  - Nilsson J
AU  - Lindström J
AU  - Fredborg W
AU  - Akenine U
AU  - Hillilä C
AU  - Andersen P
AU  - Spulber G
