TI  - The beneficial effects of cognitive training with simple calculation and reading aloud in an elderly postsurgical population: study protocol for a randomized controlled trial.
AU  - Kulason K
AU  - Nouchi R
AU  - Hoshikawa Y
AU  - Noda M
AU  - Okada Y
AU  - Kawashima R
PY  - 2016 Jul 22
JO  - Trials
VL  - 17
