TI  - Effect of blood pressure and diabetes mellitus on cognitive and physical functions in older adults: a longitudinal analysis of the advanced cognitive training for independent and vital elderly cohort.
AU  - Kuo HK
AU  - Jones RN
AU  - Milberg WP
AU  - Tennstedt S
AU  - Talbot L
AU  - Morris JN
