TI  - A pilot study on the feasibility and initial outcomes of a telerehabilitation system for balance and cognitive training in older adults.
AU  - Sedivcova ML
AU  - Mothejlova K
AU  - Hana K
AU  - Kaspar J
AU  - Buchtelova A
PY  - 2026 Mar
JO  - Biomedical papers of the Medical Faculty of the University Palacky, Olomouc, Czechoslovakia
VL  - 170
