TI  - Structural integrity of the corpus callosum predicts long-term transfer of fluid intelligence-related training gains in normal aging.
AU  - Wolf D
AU  - Fischer FU
AU  - Fesenbeckh J
AU  - Yakushev I
AU  - Lelieveld IM
AU  - Scheurich A
AU  - Schermuly I
AU  - Zschutschke L
