TI  - A Preliminary Study on the Feasibility of Using a Virtual Reality Cognitive Training Application for Remote Detection of Mild Cognitive Impairment.
AU  - Zygouris S
AU  - Ntovas K
AU  - Giakoumis D
AU  - Votis K
AU  - Doumpoulakis S
AU  - Segkouli S
AU  - Karagiannidis C
