TI  - Effectiveness of Robot-Assisted Board Games on Cognitive Function and Mental Health for Older Adults with Mild Cognitive Impairment: A Cluster Randomized Trial.
AU  - Lin LC
AU  - Liao JY
AU  - Huang CM
AU  - Lin FH
AU  - Lu LT
AU  - Chien HC
