TI  - A pilot randomized controlled trial using EEG-based brain-computer interface training for a Chinese-speaking group of healthy elderly.
AU  - Lee TS
AU  - Quek SY
AU  - Goh SJ
AU  - Phillips R
AU  - Guan C
AU  - Cheung YB
AU  - Feng L
