TI  - The effect of working memory training on patient and informant reported executive function in mild cognitive impairment: an interventional study.
AU  - Nordnes PR
AU  - Edwin TH
AU  - Flak MM
AU  - Løhaugen GCC
AU  - Skranes J
AU  - Chang L
AU  - Hol HR
AU  - Ulstein I
