TI  - Predicting short- and long-term cognitive training success in healthy older adults: who benefits?
AU  - Roheger M
AU  - Meyer J
AU  - Kessler J
AU  - Kalbe E
PY  - 2020 May
JO  - Neuropsychology, development, and cognition. Section B, Aging, neuropsychology and cognition
VL  - 27
