TI  - Development and effectiveness of virtual interactive working memory training for older people with mild cognitive impairment: a single-blind randomised controlled trial.
AU  - Yang HL
AU  - Chu H
AU  - Kao CC
AU  - Chiu HL
AU  - Tseng IJ
