TI  - Can transcranial direct current stimulation combined with interactive computerized cognitive training boost cognition and gait performance in older adults with mild cognitive impairment? a randomized controlled trial.
AU  - Lau CI
AU  - Liu MN
AU  - Cheng FY
AU  - Wang HC
AU  - Walsh V
AU  - Liao YY
PY  - 2024 Feb 16
JO  - Journal of neuroengineering and rehabilitation
VL  - 21
