TI  - Neuronavigated Magnetic Stimulation combined with cognitive training for Alzheimer's patients: an EEG graph study.
AU  - Vecchio F
AU  - Quaranta D
AU  - Miraglia F
AU  - Pappalettera C
AU  - Di Iorio R
AU  - L'Abbate F
AU  - Cotelli M
