TI  - Effect of computerized cognitive training with virtual spatial navigation task during bed rest immobilization and recovery on vascular function: a pilot study.
AU  - Goswami N
AU  - Kavcic V
AU  - Marusic U
AU  - Simunic B
AU  - Rössler A
AU  - Hinghofer-Szalkay H
