TI  - Chronic pain and subjective memory problems are dynamic risk factors for functional decline: An ACTIVE longitudinal study.
AU  - Bell TR
AU  - Felix C
AU  - Gider N
AU  - Rebok GW
AU  - Crowe M
AU  - Ball K
AU  - Wallace G
AU  - Black S
AU  - Thomas KR
