TI  - Cognitive training and brain stimulation in prodromal Alzheimer's disease (AD-Stim)-study protocol for a double-blind randomized controlled phase IIb (monocenter) trial.
AU  - Thams F
AU  - Kuzmina A
AU  - Backhaus M
AU  - Li SC
