TI  - Improvement in executive function for older adults through smartphone apps: a randomized clinical trial comparing language learning and brain training.
AU  - Meltzer JA
AU  - Kates Rose M
AU  - Le AY
AU  - Spencer KA
AU  - Goldstein L
AU  - Gubanova A
AU  - Lai AC
AU  - Yossofzai M
AU  - Armstrong SEM
AU  - Bialystok E
PY  - 2023 Mar
