TI  - Machine learning and individual variability in electric field characteristics predict tDCS treatment response.
AU  - Albizu A
AU  - Fang R
AU  - Indahlastari A
AU  - O'Shea A
AU  - Stolte SE
AU  - See KB
AU  - Boutzoukas EM
