TI  - Efficacy of a Mobile-Based Multidomain Intervention to Improve Cognitive Function and Health-Related Outcomes Among Older Korean Adults with Subjective Cognitive Decline.
AU  - Lee J
AU  - Kim J
AU  - Park A
AU  - Hong RK
AU  - Ko M
AU  - Heo M
AU  - Kim H
