TI  - Lifestyle multidomain intervention, omega-3 supplementation, or both for reducing the risk of developing clinically relevant depressive symptoms in older adults with memory complaints? Secondary analysis from the MAPT trial.
AU  - Maltais M
AU  - de Souto Barreto P
AU  - Pothier K
AU  - Cantet C
AU  - Andrieu S
AU  - Rolland Y
