TI  - Effects of cognitive training on change in accuracy in inductive reasoning ability.
AU  - Boron JB
AU  - Turiano NA
AU  - Willis SL
AU  - Schaie KW
PY  - 2007 May
JO  - The journals of gerontology. Series B, Psychological sciences and social sciences
VL  - 62
