TI  - A cognitive training program based on principles of brain plasticity: results from the Improvement in Memory with Plasticity-based Adaptive Cognitive Training (IMPACT) study.
AU  - Smith GE
AU  - Housen P
AU  - Yaffe K
AU  - Ruff R
AU  - Kennison RF
AU  - Mahncke HW
AU  - Zelinski EM
