TI  - Cognitive training in Alzheimer's disease: a controlled randomized study.
AU  - Giovagnoli AR
AU  - Manfredi V
AU  - Parente A
AU  - Schifano L
AU  - Oliveri S
AU  - Avanzini G
PY  - 2017 Aug
