TI  - A 2-Year Longitudinal Randomized Control Trial of Speed of Processing Cognitive Training in Aging Adults with HIV-Associated Neurocognitive Disorder: Results of the Think Fast Study.
AU  - Vance DE
AU  - Fazeli PL
AU  - Azuero A
AU  - Frank JS
AU  - Wadley VG
AU  - Raper JL
AU  - Pope CN
AU  - Ball KK
