TI  - Synergistic effects of aerobic exercise and cognitive training on cognition, physiological markers, daily function, and quality of life in stroke survivors with cognitive decline: study protocol for a randomized controlled trial.
AU  - Yeh TT
AU  - Wu CY
AU  - Hsieh YW
AU  - Chang KC
