TI  - Cognitive training and promoting a healthy lifestyle for individuals with isolated REM sleep behavior disorder: study protocol of the delayed-start randomized controlled trial CogTrAiL-RBD.
AU  - Ophey A
AU  - Röttgen S
AU  - Pauquet J
AU  - Weiß KL
AU  - Scharfenberg D
