TI  - Efficacy of cognitive rehabilitation in patients with mild cognitive impairment treated with cholinesterase inhibitors.
AU  - Rozzini L
AU  - Costardi D
AU  - Chilovi BV
AU  - Franzoni S
AU  - Trabucchi M
