TI  - Effects of elastic band resistance training and nutritional supplementation on muscle quality and circulating muscle growth and degradation factors of institutionalized elderly women: the Vienna Active Ageing Study (VAAS).
AU  - Hofmann M
AU  - Schober-Halper B
AU  - Oesen S
AU  - Franzke B
AU  - Tschan H
AU  - Bachl N
AU  - Strasser EM
AU  - Quittan M
AU  - Wagner KH
AU  - Wessner B
