TI  - Effects of a 6-month dual-task, power-based exercise program on cognitive function, neurological and inflammatory markers in older adults: secondary analysis of a cluster randomised controlled trial.
AU  - Tait JL
AU  - Duckham RL
AU  - Rantalainen T
AU  - Milte CM
AU  - Main LC
AU  - Nowson CA
