TI  - Computer aided self-regulation learning and cognitive training improve generalization ability of patients with poststroke cognitive impairment.
AU  - Youze H
AU  - Ting Y
AU  - Yaqi B
AU  - Tianshen X
AU  - Tiecheng W
AU  - Jingsong W
PY  - 2021 Dec 17
JO  - Scientific reports
