TI  - Computerized Cognitive and Skills Training in Older People With Mild Cognitive Impairment: Using Ecological Momentary Assessment to Index Treatment-Related Changes in Real-World Performance of Technology-Dependent Functional Tasks.
AU  - Dowell-Esquivel C
AU  - Czaja SJ
AU  - Kallestrup P
AU  - Depp CA
AU  - Saber JN
AU  - Harvey PD
PY  - 2024 Apr
