TI  - "Camminando e Leggendo ...   Ricordo" (Walking and Reading ...   I Remember): Prevention of Frailty Through the Promotion of Physical Activity and Reading in People with Mild Cognitive Impairment. Results from the TREDEM Registry.
AU  - Gallucci M
