TI  - Effect of a multicomponent exercise program and cognitive stimulation (VIVIFRAIL-COGN) on falls in frail community older persons with high risk of falls: study protocol for a randomized multicenter control trial.
AU  - Sánchez-Sánchez JL
AU  - Udina C
AU  - Medina-Rincón A
AU  - Esbrí-Victor M
AU  - Bartolomé-Martín I
AU  - Moral-Cuesta D
