TI  - Transcranial direct current stimulation combined with cognitive training for the treatment of Parkinson Disease: A randomized, placebo-controlled study.
AU  - Manenti R
AU  - Cotelli MS
AU  - Cobelli C
AU  - Gobbi E
AU  - Brambilla M
