TI  - Effects of Cognitive Training on Balance and Motor Symptoms in Parkinson's Disease: An Exploratory Randomized Controlled Trial.
AU  - Arroyo-Ferrer A
AU  - Moreno-Verdú M
AU  - Sánchez-Cuesta FJ
AU  - González-Zamorano Y
AU  - Ugalde-Canitrot A
