TI  - Effects of a Mixed Reality-based Cognitive Training System Compared to a Conventional Computer-assisted Cognitive Training System on Mild Cognitive Impairment: A Pilot Study.
AU  - Park E
AU  - Yun BJ
AU  - Min YS
AU  - Lee YS
AU  - Moon SJ
AU  - Huh JW
AU  - Cha H
AU  - Chang Y
AU  - Jung TD
