TI  - Two-year clinical trial examining the effects of speed of processing training on everyday functioning in adults with human immunodeficiency virus-associated neurocognitive disorder (HAND) and borderline HAND in the U.S. Deep South: Findings of the Think Fast Study.
AU  - Vance DE
AU  - Fazeli PL
AU  - Azuero A
AU  - Khalidi S
AU  - Frank JS
AU  - Wadley VG
AU  - Raper JL
