TI  - The APPLE Tree programme: Active Prevention in People at risk of dementia through Lifestyle, bEhaviour change and Technology to build REsiliEnce-randomised controlled trial.
AU  - Poppe M
AU  - Duffy L
AU  - Marchant NL
AU  - Barber JA
