TI  - Virtual Reality in Training of Sustained Attention, Processing Speed, and Working Memory After Traumatic Brain Injury: A Randomized Controlled Trial.
AU  - Johansen T
AU  - Matre M
AU  - Løvstad M
AU  - Olsen A
AU  - Lund A
AU  - Martinsen AT
AU  - Becker F
AU  - Brunborg C
