TI  - MSK1 is required for the beneficial synaptic and cognitive effects of enriched experience across the lifespan.
AU  - Morè L
AU  - Privitera L
AU  - Cooper DD
AU  - Tsogka M
AU  - Arthur JSC
AU  - Frenguelli BG
PY  - 2023 Jul 10
JO  - Aging
VL  - 15
