TI  - A Feasibility Study for Implementation "Health Arcade": A Study Protocol for Prototype of Multidomain Intervention Based on Gamification Technologies in Acutely Hospitalized Older Patients.
AU  - Cuevas-Lara C
AU  - Izquierdo M
AU  - Zambom-Ferraresi F
AU  - Sáez de Asteasu ML
