TI  - Cognitive Effects of Multi-Domain Interventions Among Pre-Frail and Frail Community-Living Older Persons: Randomized Controlled Trial.
AU  - Ng TP
AU  - Ling LHA
AU  - Feng L
AU  - Nyunt MSZ
AU  - Feng L
AU  - Niti M
AU  - Tan BY
AU  - Chan G
AU  - Khoo SA
AU  - Chan SM
