TI  - Untreated if unrecognized: A cognitive profile of sustained subjective executive dysfunctions in COVID-19.
AU  - de Groot BO
AU  - Biserni C
AU  - Fuermaier ABM
AU  - Enriquez-Geppert S
PY  - 2025 Jul-Aug
JO  - Applied neuropsychology. Adult
