TI  - Evaluating two group programmes of cognitive training in mild-to-moderate AD: is there any difference between a 'global' stimulation and a 'cognitive-specific' one?
AU  - Farina E
AU  - Mantovani F
AU  - Fioravanti R
AU  - Pignatti R
AU  - Chiavari L
AU  - Imbornone E
AU  - Olivotto F
AU  - Alberoni M
