TI  - Participatory approaches for developing a practical handbook integrating health information for supporting individuals with mild cognitive impairment and their families.
AU  - Kuroda Y
AU  - Goto A
AU  - Sugimoto T
AU  - Fujita K
AU  - Uchida K
AU  - Matsumoto N
AU  - Shimada H
AU  - Ohtsuka R
AU  - Yamada M
AU  - Fujiwara Y
AU  - Seike A
