TI  - Training response inhibition to food is associated with weight loss and reduced energy intake.
AU  - Lawrence NS
AU  - O'Sullivan J
AU  - Parslow D
AU  - Javaid M
AU  - Adams RC
AU  - Chambers CD
AU  - Kos K
AU  - Verbruggen F
