TI  - [Clinical efficacy of acupuncture on mild cognitive impairment and its effect on gut microbiota].
AU  - Jiang P
AU  - Hu F
AU  - Lin M
AU  - Zhu J
PY  - 2025 Jul 12
JO  - Zhongguo zhen jiu = Chinese acupuncture & moxibustion
VL  - 45
