TI  - Cardiorespiratory fitness and cognitive functioning following short-term interventions in chronic stroke survivors with cognitive impairment: a pilot study.
AU  - Blanchet S
AU  - Richards CL
AU  - Leblond J
AU  - Olivier C
AU  - Maltais DB
PY  - 2016 Jun
JO  - International journal of rehabilitation research. Internationale Zeitschrift fur Rehabilitationsforschung. Revue internationale de recherches de readaptation
VL  - 39
IS  - 2
