TI  - Nutrition guidance within a multimodal intervention improves diet quality in prodromal Alzheimer's disease: Multimodal Preventive Trial for Alzheimer's Disease (MIND-AD(mini)).
AU  - Levak N
AU  - Lehtisalo J
AU  - Thunborg C
AU  - Westman E
AU  - Andersen P
AU  - Andrieu S
