TI  - Cognitive training and retest learning effects on theta and alpha power in older and young adults: A perspective on the crunch hypothesis and the STAC-R model.
AU  - Zając-Lamparska L
AU  - Zabielska-Mendyk E
AU  - Zapała D
AU  - Augustynowicz P
PY  - 2025 Apr-Jun
JO  - International journal of clinical and health psychology : IJCHP
VL  - 25
