TI  - A Dual-Task Paradigm Combining Physical and Cognitive Training in Mice: Application to Aging.
AU  - Attoh-Mensah E
AU  - Huret A
AU  - Leger M
AU  - Loggia G
AU  - Nee G
AU  - Largilliere S
AU  - Zuba D
