TI  - Effects of Transcranial Direct Current Stimulation Paired With Cognitive Training on Functional Connectivity of the Working Memory Network in Older Adults.
AU  - Nissim NR
AU  - O'Shea A
AU  - Indahlastari A
AU  - Kraft JN
AU  - von Mering O
AU  - Aksu S
