TI  - Effects of immersive leisure-based virtual reality cognitive training on cognitive and physical function in community-based older adults: A randomized controlled trial.
AU  - Chuang IC
AU  - Abdullahi A
AU  - Chen IC
AU  - Wu YR
AU  - Wu CY
PY  - 2025 Jan-Dec
JO  - Digital health
VL  - 11
SP  - 20552076251328491
