TI  - Effects of computer-based cognitive training combined with physical training for older adults with cognitive impairment: A four-arm randomized controlled trial.
AU  - Chuang IC
AU  - Chiau HY
AU  - Liao WW
AU  - Wu YR
AU  - Chang CH
AU  - Wu CY
PY  - 2023 Jan-Dec
