TI  - Effects of Virtual Reality-Based Physical and Cognitive Training on Executive Function and Dual-Task Gait Performance in Older Adults With Mild Cognitive Impairment: A Randomized Control Trial.
AU  - Liao YY
AU  - Chen IH
AU  - Lin YJ
AU  - Chen Y
AU  - Hsu WC
PY  - 2019
JO  - Frontiers in aging neuroscience
VL  - 11
SP  - 162
