TI  - Relations Between Cardiorespiratory Fitness and Cognition in Older Adults With Amnestic Mild Cognitive Impairment From the Aerobic Exercise and Cognitive Training (ACT) Trial: Sex Differences.
AU  - Yu F
AU  - Salisbury D
AU  - Pituch KA
AU  - Lin FV
PY  - 2024 Jun
JO  - Archives of rehabilitation research and clinical translation
VL  - 6
