TI  - In person versus remote cognitive rehabilitation in patients with subjective cognitive decline or neurocognitive disorders: what factors drive patient's preference?
AU  - Bernini S
AU  - Ballante E
AU  - Fassio F
AU  - Panzarasa S
AU  - Quaglini S
AU  - Riccietti C
AU  - Costa A
AU  - Cappa SF
