TI  - Working memory training in children with neurodevelopmental disorders and intellectual disabilities, the role of coaching: A double‐blind randomised controlled trial
AU  - Roording‐Ragetlie, S. L.
AU  - Pieters, S.
AU  - Wennekers, E.
AU  - Klip, H.
AU  - Buitelaar, J.
AU  - Slaats‐Willemse, D.
