TI  - Clinical considerations when using assessment tools to identify depression in older adults with mild cognitive impairment
AU  - Lee, Allen Ting Chun
AU  - Chiu, Helen Fung Kum
AU  - Peisah, Carmelle
PY  - 2022
JO  - International Psychogeriatrics
VL  - 34
