TI  - Cognitive-postural multitasking training in older adults—Effects of input-output modality mappings on cognitive performance and postural control
AU  - Brahms, Markus
AU  - Heinzel, Stephan
AU  - Rapp, Michael
AU  - Reisner, Volker
AU  - Wahmkow, Gunnar
AU  - Rimpel, Jérôme
