TI  - Aging and network properties: Stability over time and links with learning during working memory training
AU  - Iordan, Alexandru D.
AU  - Cooke, Katherine A.
AU  - Moored, Kyle D.
AU  - Katz, Benjamin
AU  - Buschkuehl, Martin
AU  - Jaeggi, Susanne M.
