TI  - EEG alpha power during maintenance of information in working memory in adults with ADHD and its plasticity due to working memory training: A randomized controlled trial
AU  - Liu, Zhong-Xu
AU  - Glizer, Daniel
AU  - Tannock, Rosemary
AU  - Woltering, Steven
