TI  - Pattern of Near Transfer Effects Following Working Memory Training With    a Dual \&ITN\&IT-Back Task
AU  - Soveri, Anna and Karlsson, Eric P. A. and Waris, Otto and    Gronholm-Nyman, Petra and Laine, Matti
PY  - 2017
JO  - EXPERIMENTAL PSYCHOLOGY
VL  - 64
