AB  - Physical and cognitive training can maintain and improve older adults'    independence and quality of life. Given the demographic growth of the    older adult population and the shortage of caregivers, there is a need    for personal trainers for physical and cognitive activities. This study    suggests that social robots can satisfy this demand and presents the    development of ``Gymmy{''
KW  - robotic trainer; older adults; human-robot interaction; technology    acceptance; assistive robot; social robot
